# ripgrep-only. These paths are TRACKED but gitignored, and git exempts
# tracked files from .gitignore while ripgrep does not -- so they are
# committed, diffed and shipped through PRs while being invisible to search.
# Re-included here for rg only; nothing about git changes.
#
# NOT included: LICENSES.md. It is a SYMLINK to frontend/static/LICENSES.md,
# which rg already lists, so its content is searchable via the real path and a
# negation here would be a no-op. rg does not follow symlinks without
# --follow, and that is correct rather than a defect.
!docs/plans/
